  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">220302_FY23_UNICEF_Somalia_Nutrition services for children and women in Somaliland</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Total no of beneficiaries is 207,336 as per the below breakdown:
 
  Under 1: 21,528 (10,548 boys; 10,980 girls)
 
  Under 5: 107,642 (52,745 boys; 54,897 girls)
 
  Pregnant and lactating women: 48,438
 
  Pregnant women: 21,528 
 
  Health care workers: 108 
 
  Boys and girls with Severe Acute Malnutrition: 8,092
 
 
 
 
 
 1. Increased and more equitable access to quality preventative nutrition services to girls and boys under five years of age, adolescent girls and women during pregnancy and breastfeeding in Somalia by 2025
 
 2. Increased and more equitable access to quality nutrition services for early detection and treatment of wasting for girls and boys under five years of age by 2025</narrative>
  </description>
